{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 1, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct", "content": "Dear Team\n\nI hope this message finds you well and thriving in your current projects. I am writing to formally invite you to an important gathering that will bring together key contributors from across our departments to discuss critical developments and shared goals for the coming quarter. This meeting is designed to foster deeper collaboration and to align our efforts in a way that supports both individual success and organizational growth.\n\nYou have been selected to attend because of your unique insights and active involvement in initiatives that are correlated with our upcoming strategic priorities. Your perspective is not only valued but essential as we work to refine our approach and anticipate challenges before they arise. We are especially interested in hearing from those who are currently experiencing shifts in workflow client expectations or operational dynamics as these experiences will help shape the direction of our collective strategy.\n\nThe meeting will take place on Thursday June 20th at 1000 AM in the Main Conference Room on the fifth floor. We have reserved the space for three hours to allow ample time for discussion reflection and planning. Light refreshments will be provided and we encourage you to arrive a few minutes early so we can begin promptly. If you are unable to attend in person please let me know as soon as possible so we can arrange a virtual connection via Zoom. The link will be sent to you the day before the event.\n\nDuring the session we will review recent performance metrics identify emerging trends and explore how we can better support each other across teams. A significant portion of the meeting will be dedicated to open dialogue where everyone is encouraged to share their thoughts without restriction. We believe that the most powerful solutions come from honest conversations and diverse viewpoints. Your voice matters and we want to hear what you have to say.\n\nWe will also introduce a new collaborative platform that is designed to streamline communication and reduce redundancy in our processes. This tool has been tested in pilot groups and feedback has been overwhelmingly positive. We will walk you through its features and answer any questions you may have. The goal is to ensure that every participant feels confident and empowered to use it effectively from day one.\n\nThis meeting is not about reporting or presenting polished summaries. It is about listening learning and building together. We are all experiencing change at different speeds and in different ways. Some of you may be seeing increased demand while others are adjusting to new systems. These differences are not obstacles they are opportunities. When we recognize how our experiences are correlated we can design solutions that work for everyone.\n\nPlease confirm your attendance by Friday June 14th so we can finalize seating arrangements and prepare materials accordingly. If you have any topics you would like to see included in the agenda please reply directly to this email with your suggestions. We are committed to making this a meaningful and productive experience for all.\n\nThank you for your dedication and for being such an important part of our team. We look forward to seeing you there and to building something great together.\n\nWarm regards\n\nAlex Morgan  \nProject Lead  \nInnovation & Collaboration Division  \nCompany Name  \nEmail alex.morgan@company.com  \nPhone 555 123 4567", "logprobs": [{"token": "Dear", "logprob": -0.03817349299788475}, {"token": " Team", "logprob": -0.13892149925231934}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.049630362540483475}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.014316700398921967}, {"token": " hope", "logprob": -0.00978246983140707}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -5.876845170860179e-05}, {"token": " message", "logprob": -2.932505594799295e-05}, {"token": " finds", "logprob": -1.20